    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## View-growth tracking\n\nOnly views determine whether a post remains in the paid Apify refresh loop.\n\n- First observation establishes a view baseline.\n- Active posts are refreshed daily.\n- At 72 hours, view growth is compared with the baseline.\n- Growth >= 10%: keep active and start a new 72-hour window.\n- Growth < 10%: set `stopped_stagnant` and exclude before Apify.\n- Likes/comments are stored for reporting only.\n- The sheet is read without a fixed row limit.\n- Paid refreshes are capped at 1,000 due posts per run; tracked posts have priority.\n\nStopped posts can be reactivated explicitly by changing their tracking state and clearing the window fields.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c09053aa-f50f-4904-99e4-820bbaba4df3",
      "name": "READ ME: Tracking state",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
